{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733826617524224050","content":"Melee Weapon The hunger briefly teleports to its chosen location. Attack: +14 to hit, reach 60 ft., one target. Hit: 22 (3d10 + 6) piercing damage, and the target is swallowed if it is a Medium or smaller creature. A swallowed creature is blinded and restrained, has total cover against attacks and other effects outside the hunger, and takes 10 (3d6) acid damage at the start of each of the hungers turns.If the The Hunger takes 45 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, it must succeed on a DC 23 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, which fall prone in a space within 10 feet of the The Hunger. If the The Hunger dies, a swallowed creature is no longer restrained by it and can escape from the corpse using 10 feet of movement, exiting prone. After the action is complete it teleports back to its original location.","created_at":"2020-08-22T02:39:53.350000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-22T02:45:54.879000Z","id":"746559240562278521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
